/item><item><title><![CDATA[NASA satellites revealed 14 active water areas beneath Antarctica; one lake drained 2 cubic km in 3 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133491906.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scientists discovered active subglacial lakes beneath Antarctica's ice sheet. NASA satellite data revealed ice surface changes indicating water movement. These hidden lakes were found to fill and drain over short periods. This dynamic water system influences ice stream speeds and mass balance. The findings showed a hidden, active world beneath the frozen continent.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-2007-scientists-used-nasa-satellite-measurements-to-reveal-14-areas-of-moving-water-beneath-west-antarctica-one-hidden-lake-had-drained-about-2-cubic-kilometres-in-three-years/articleshow/133491906.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-2007-scientists-used-nasa-satellite-measurements-to-reveal-14-areas-of-moving-water-beneath-west-antarctica-one-hidden-lake-had-drained-about-2-cubic-kilometres-in-three-years/articleshow/133491906.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-25T10:07:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133492253,imgsize-1810861.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Texas turned 68,000 acres of solar farms into grazing ground for sheep]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133492033.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/texas-turned-68000-acres-of-solar-farms-into-grazing-ground-for-sheep-revealing-how-solar-land-could-become-a-new-resource-for-american-farmers/articleshow/133